                          513 | ;   A NICE IDEA, BUT THINGS GET SCREWED UP BY
                          514 | ;   BACKSPACING THEN RETYPING AT TAB LOCATIONS,
                          515 | ;   AND BY CONTROL CHARACTERS BEING DISPLAYED AS
                          516 | ;   TWO CHARACTERS, BUT STORED IN MEMORY AS ONLY
