F871: 77                 2903 |     MOV M,A ; AND PUT THEM BACK IN FCB
F872: CD 45 F8           2904 |     CALL    COM14   ;SELECT DISK DRIVE
F875: 3A 41 EF           2905 | SETUP1: LDA USERNO  ;GET THE USER NUMBER
